---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="RM Performance — Meta Ads with payment per enquiry | RM CREATIVES" description="Patient acquisition through Meta Ads for medical clinics and beauty studios. Pay for agreed qualified enquiries, not a monthly management retainer.">
<main>
<section class="hero shell"><div class="eyebrow top"><span>RM / PRODUCT 01</span><span>META ADS / PATIENT ACQUISITION</span></div><div class="hero-grid"><div><h1>Pay for<br/><em>enquiries.</em><br/>Not retainers.</h1></div><aside><p>For clinics that are tired of paying a monthly fee regardless of the result.</p><a href="/contact">Calculate enquiry cost ↗</a></aside></div></section>
<section class="statement"><div class="shell statement-grid"><span class="eyebrow">THE MODEL</span><h2>You don't buy<br/>our time.</h2><p>You buy a measurable flow of patient enquiries. Before launch, we agree how the commercial model works for the selected clinic services.</p></div></section>
<section class="compare shell"><div class="old"><span class="eyebrow">THE USUAL MODEL</span><h3>Pay every month.</h3><div class="rows"><p><span>Agency retainer</span><b>€ / MONTH</b></p><p><span>Campaign setup</span><b>+</b></p><p><span>Creative testing</span><b>+</b></p><p><span>Result</span><b>?</b></p></div><small>You pay for the work even when the campaigns do not produce enough enquiries.</small></div><div class="new"><span class="eyebrow">RM PERFORMANCE</span><h3>Pay for enquiries.</h3><div class="formula"><span>50</span><i>ENQUIRIES</i><b>×</b><span>€X</span><i>AGREED PRICE</i></div><div class="equals"><span>=</span><strong>ONE CLEAR<br/>COMMERCIAL MODEL</strong></div><small>Strategy, campaign management, offer testing, optimisation and creatives stay on our side.</small></div></section>
<section class="responsibility"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">WHO CONTROLS WHAT</span><h2>A clean line of<br/>responsibility.</h2></div><div class="split"><div><span class="eyebrow">RM CREATIVES</span><h3>We are responsible for getting the enquiry.</h3><ul><li>Strategy & campaign structure</li><li>Offers & creative concepts</li><li>Meta Ads setup</li><li>Testing & optimisation</li><li>Tracking the enquiry</li></ul></div><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR CLINIC</span><h3>You are responsible for what happens after it.</h3><ul><li>Response speed</li><li>Sales / patient communication</li><li>Appointment availability</li><li>Booking conversion</li><li>Patient experience</li></ul></div></div></div></section>
<section class="flow shell"><span class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</span><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Choose services</h3><p>We select up to several priority services where Meta can realistically generate demand.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Estimate economics</h3><p>We assess the offer, market and expected enquiry cost before agreeing the model.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Launch & test</h3><p>We build campaigns, creatives and offers and continuously improve what converts.</p></div><div><b>04</b><h3>Pay for result</h3><p>The commercial model is tied to the agreed enquiries rather than hours spent managing ads.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="proof"><div class="shell proof-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">REAL WORK / META ADS</span><h2>The model is built on years of clinic acquisition.</h2><a href="/cases">See all Meta Ads cases ↗</a></div><div class="metric"><strong>2,970</strong><span>EPILINE · META ENQUIRIES<br/>JAN–AUG 2026</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>1,902</strong><span>DENTA · META ENQUIRIES<br/>JAN–AUG 2026</span></div><div class="metric"><strong>€2.75</strong><span>UNION KLINIKA<br/>WEIGHTED CPL · MAY–DEC 2024</span></div></div></section>
<section class="not"><div class="shell not-grid"><span class="eyebrow">IMPORTANT</span><h2>We sell enquiries.<br/>Not patients.</h2><p>Whether an enquiry becomes an appointment or a patient depends on the clinic's team, availability and sales process. We don't promise what we don't control.</p></div></section>
<section class="cta shell"><span class="eyebrow">RM PERFORMANCE</span><h2>How much could an enquiry cost for your clinic?</h2><p>Tell us the services you want to promote. We'll make a preliminary assessment and discuss whether the model fits.</p><a href="/contact">Calculate enquiry cost ↗</a></section>
<section class="related shell"><div class="related-head"><span class="eyebrow">RELATED CASES / META ADS</span><h2>See how Meta Ads performs in real clinic projects.</h2></div><div class="case-cards"><a href="/cases/epiline/meta-ads"><span class="eyebrow">EPILINE / META ADS</span><h3>Scale volume without losing control of CPL.</h3><strong>2,970</strong><p>Meta enquiries · Jan–Aug 2026</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a><a href="/cases/denta/meta-ads"><span class="eyebrow">DENTA / META ADS</span><h3>Build a predictable paid social channel for dentistry.</h3><strong>1,902</strong><p>Meta enquiries · Jan–Aug 2026</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a><a href="/cases/union-klinika/meta-ads"><span class="eyebrow">UNION KLINIKA / META ADS</span><h3>Patient acquisition with a limited marketing budget.</h3><strong>€2.75</strong><p>Weighted CPL · May–Dec 2024</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a><a href="/cases/consilium-medicum/meta-ads"><span class="eyebrow">CONSILIUM MEDICUM / META ADS</span><h3>Create patient demand beyond Google Search.</h3><strong>META</strong><p>Paid social for medical services</p><b>READ CASE ↗</b></a></div></section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.hero{padding:38px 0 120px;min-height:780px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:15px}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.55fr .45fr;gap:70px;align-items:end;margin-top:100px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(72px,10.5vw,160px);line-height:.82;letter-spacing:-.075em;margin:0;font-weight:650}.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}.hero aside{padding-bottom:12px}.hero aside p{font-size:21px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 45px}.hero aside a,.cta a{display:inline-block;background:var(--ink);color:white;padding:18px 22px;font-weight:650}.statement{background:var(--accent);padding:110px 0}.statement-grid,.not-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.45fr 1fr .65fr;gap:55px;align-items:start}.statement h2,.not h2{font-size:clamp(50px,6vw,90px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:0}.statement p,.not p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;margin:0}.compare{padding:130px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.compare>div{min-height:580px;padding:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.old{background:#deddd6}.new{background:var(--dark);color:white}.compare h3{font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,62px);letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:65px 0 35px}.rows{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.rows p{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0;margin:0}.rows b{font:11px monospace}.compare small{margin-top:auto;max-width:440px;line-height:1.5;opacity:.6}.formula{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto auto auto auto;align-items:end;gap:12px;margin-top:55px}.formula span{font-size:clamp(58px,6vw,90px);letter-spacing:-.07em}.formula i{font:9px monospace;font-style:normal;opacity:.55;padding-bottom:15px}.formula b{font-size:35px;padding-bottom:16px}.equals{border-top:1px solid #444;margin-top:25px;padding-top:25px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.equals strong{text-align:right;font-size:18px}.responsibility{background:#e4e3dd;padding:120px 0}.section-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.45fr 1.65fr;margin-bottom:70px}.section-head h2{font-size:clamp(50px,6vw,90px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:0}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}.split>div{padding:35px 45px 30px 0}.split>div+div{padding-left:45px;border-left:1px solid var(--ink)}.split h3{font-size:30px;max-width:500px;line-height:1.15;margin:50px 0}.split ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.split li{padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted)}.flow{padding:140px 0}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);margin-top:45px;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}.steps>div{padding:25px 30px 70px 0}.steps>div+div{padding-left:30px;border-left:1px solid var(--line)}.steps b{font:11px monospace}.steps h3{font-size:27px;margin:70px 0 15px}.steps p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;font-size:14px}.proof{background:var(--dark);color:white;padding:120px 0}.proof-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr repeat(3,.7fr);gap:0}.proof-grid>div{padding:25px;border-left:1px solid #333}.proof-grid>div:first-child{border-left:0}.proof h2{font-size:40px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.04em;max-width:480px;margin:45px 0}.proof a{font-size:12px;border-bottom:1px solid white}.metric{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:330px}.metric strong{font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,76px);letter-spacing:-.065em}.metric span{font:10px monospace;line-height:1.5;color:#888;margin-top:12px}.not{padding:120px 0;background:#e2e1db}.cta{padding:150px 0}.cta h2{font-size:clamp(60px,8vw,118px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.065em;max-width:1200px;margin:30px 0}.cta p{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);max-width:600px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:40px}.related{padding:40px 0 140px}.related-head{border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding-top:30px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.45fr 1.55fr;gap:50px;align-items:start}.related-head h2{font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,76px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:0;max-width:900px}.case-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:60px}.case-cards a{min-height:390px;background:#e4e3dd;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:transform .2s ease,background .2s ease}.case-cards a:nth-child(2){background:var(--accent)}.case-cards a:nth-child(3){background:var(--dark);color:white}.case-cards a:nth-child(4){background:#d7d6cf}.case-cards a:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}.case-cards h3{font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,48px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:55px 0 30px;max-width:600px}.case-cards strong{font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,78px);letter-spacing:-.06em;margin-top:auto}.case-cards p{font:10px monospace;opacity:.62;margin:8px 0 28px}.case-cards b{font:10px monospace;font-weight:500}@media(max-width:850px){.hero-grid,.statement-grid,.not-grid,.compare,.split,.section-head,.proof-grid,.related-head{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{min-height:auto}.hero-grid{margin-top:70px}.compare>div{min-height:500px}.split>div+div{padding-left:0;border-left:0}.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.steps>div+div{padding-left:0;border-left:0}.proof-grid>div{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #333}.metric{min-height:220px}.formula{grid-template-columns:auto auto}.statement-grid,.not-grid{gap:35px}.case-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.case-cards a{min-height:330px}}
</style>